PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY

# Exact built-in PNV/1 operator arities and resolved numeric source literals.
# Proves ordering as a structural noncommutative sequence witness.
# Numerical atan2, Unicode tokenization, and vector-length validation are NOT
# implemented by the admitted PNV/1 opcode set; release remains BLOCKED.
# No callback dependency in this program.
# REPRODUCIBILITY Execute exact source; record source/graph/trace SHA256.

OP TOKEN.A SOURCE 1
OP TOKEN.B SOURCE 2
OP ORDER.FORWARD ORDER TOKEN.A TOKEN.B
OP ORDER.REVERSE ORDER TOKEN.B TOKEN.A
OP ORDER.SELF.IDENTITY IDENTITY ORDER.FORWARD ORDER.FORWARD
OP ORDER.DIFFERENCE DIFFERENCE ORDER.FORWARD ORDER.REVERSE
OP ORDER.EVIDENCE COMPOSITION ORDER.FORWARD ORDER.REVERSE ORDER.DIFFERENCE
ASSERT ORDER.SELF.IDENTITY
EMIT ORDER.EVIDENCE ORDER.DIFFERENCE
